  /cap          stable     Data capture tools.
  /cfg          stable     Show or set config values.
  /cls          stable     Clear the terminal screen.
  /credits      stable     Print acknowledgments / third-party attributions.
  /delay        stable     Wait for a duration (e.g. 500ms, 1.5s); Escape or Ctrl+C cancels.
  /demo         stable     Switch to the built-in demo device (creates its config if needed).
  /dev          preview    Device files: a part's registers as data (see /help devices).
  /edit         stable     Open a project file for editing (run/, proto/ or plugin/).
  /env          stable     Print environment variables for $(env.NAME) expansion (alias: /env.list).
  /exit         stable     Exit termapy.
  /find         stable     Navigate scrollback matches with an interactive find bar.
  /firmware     prototype  Device-side sources termapy ships: list, copy, show, dump.
  /grep         stable     Search the scrollback for lines matching a pattern (case-insensitive regex).
  /help         stable     Print the command landscape or look up a specific command.
  /log          stable     Session log: start, stop, print, fingerprint, or open it.
  /mcp          preview    MCP catalog and status (Model Context Protocol).
  /mem          preview    Device memory: dump, typed reads, writes and bit ops via /sym names.
  /os           stable     Run a shell command and show output (10s timeout). e.g. /os dir
  /ping         stable     Send a command and measure response time.
  /plugin       stable     Plugin-folder tools: list, explore, show, dump, edit.
  /port         stable     Serial port tools: connect, disconnect, list, configure.
  /print        stable     Print a message to the terminal.
  /profile      stable     Device profile commands (MCP profile schema, validator, loader).
  /proto        stable     Binary protocol tools: send, run, debug, hex, crc, info.
  /raw          stable     Send raw text to serial (no transforms or line ending).
  /repeat       stable     Repeat a command N times with optional delay (escape to cancel).
  /run          stable     Run a script file, or list available scripts.
  /search       stable     Deep-search every command's metadata (name, help, args, flags, long help).
  /seq          stable     Print sequence counters.
  /show         stable     Show a file.
  /ss           stable     Screenshot tools: save SVG/text, manage folder.
  /stop         stable     Abort a running script.
  /sym          preview    Symbol table: name -> address, or address -> name+offset.
  /term         stable     Terminal display / session toggles (echo, line_no, timestamps, ...).
  /var          stable     List user variables, or show one by name.
  /xfer         stable     File transfer: settings and XMODEM / YMODEM send and receive.

-- demo Plugins --
  /crcsend      stable     Send text with XMODEM CRC-16 appended.
